{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paloo Spiral</strong> is an action 2D platformer featuring a zany, cartoonish style. Combine classic run and gun gameplay with close melee attacks to deal heavy blows, knock enemies around and increase your combo score to unleash even more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/Paloo.png?t=1745682202\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paloo Spiral</strong> - Our bubbly, goofy protagonist with a can-do attitude. Use her blaster to stun enemies and then set them up for hard hitting melee attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/Enemies.png?t=1745682202\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enemies</strong> - From bats to bandits to multi-legged alien reptiles, each foe has their own way of attacking. Use your different moves and abilities to dodge, shoot, and knock the enemies into each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690450/extras/Drill.png?t=1745682202\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moves</strong> - Paloo faces many foes, but also has many abilities at her disposal. Her stun blaster will open up enemies so that they can combo'd. Use Paloo's signature drill attack, ground pound and other abilities to send enemies flying when they are stunned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planet Pokolo</strong> - Explore the zany planet of Pokolo, from the shanty town near Pok-Rok Canyon, to the chaotic streets of Rinka-Dink Capital.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams